# Workers

Read `docs/workers.md`. Use skill `firona-workers`.

- `celery -A config` for worker and beat. Broker is Redis.
- No Facebook scraping. `assert_can_collect` before HTTP (`docs/sources.md`).
- HTTP collectors since v3; v4 adds retries, budgets, a lock, daily upserts and `CollectionRun` (see `docs/workers.md`).
